      "id": "claim_b7f51fa2567b434789480ec2e8679f0c",
      "statement": "The user-supplied Ollama base URL is SSRF-guarded independently in two processes: the BFF's agent-config-ssrf.ts and the gateway's src/ollama_guard.py (invoked from models.py), because a check made in one process can be stale by the time the other process opens the connection.",
